                          "String": "The effect of dietary myristic acid, fed as trimyristin either mixed or interesterified with groundnut oil, on serum cholesterol levels was examined in rats. Incorporation of trimyristin in the oil resulted in marked incr in serum cholesterol levels, compared with rats fed groundnut oil only, although a direct relation between serum cholesterol & the myristic acid content of the dietary fat was not apparent. /Ttrimyristin/",
